Fork PR (same branch, for browsing): https://github.com/AlexPerrin/OpenRune-Server/pull/6

**Problem.** In Children of the Sun the quest varbit `vmq1` goes from 12 (marking the guards) straight to 16 (the castle roof) in Sergeant Tobyn's dialogue. Quest Helper has a step at 14 between them, "Report back to Sergeant Tobyn." ([Zoinkwiz/quest-helper](https://github.com/Zoinkwiz/quest-helper), `ChildrenOfTheSun.java`). The server never sets 14, so after all four bandits are marked Quest Helper keeps showing the marking step.

**Change.** `CotsStage.MarkedAll = 14`. The fourth correct mark sets 14; unmarking a guard at 14 goes back to 12. At 14 the guards stay markable and visible and Tobyn's marking dialogue answers as at 12 (it moves on to 16 as before). The journal's marking entry covers 12..14.

**Tests.** Two new cases in `ChildrenOfTheSunInteractionTest`: marking the four bandits moves to 14 and an unmark moves back to 12; four marks that include an honest guard stay at 12. `./gradlew :content:quest:test`.

**Caveats.** That OSRS sets 14 on the fourth mark (rather than when talking to Tobyn) is inferred from Quest Helper's step text, not seen on live.

**Release note.** Children of the Sun sets its "report back to Tobyn" stage once the four bandits are marked, so Quest Helper moves on.

